      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "夜のあなたは、明日のあなたに借金を作りがちだから。",
      "displayText": "Night-you tends to create debt for tomorrow-you.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "閉じるものを三つ。画面、作業、今日の反省会。",
      "displayText": "Close three things: the screen, the work, and tonight's review meeting with yourself.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_04",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_04",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "最後のやつが一番しつこいけど、明日に回していい。",
      "displayText": "The last one is the most stubborn, but you can move it to tomorrow.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "sleep_nudge_001_05",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sleep_nudge_001_05",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "私はここで栞を挟んでおく。続きは、朝のあなたに渡そう。",
      "displayText": "I will place a bookmark here. Let us hand the rest to morning-you.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
